!osalcore:(6)==0x47:  Current Memory usage: %d(7,4,M) Allocs: %d(11,4,M) Frees: %d(15,4,M)

!osalcore:(6)==0x48:  Alloc %d(7,4,M) Bytes Error for Task ID:%d(11,4,M) Free Size:%d(15,4,M)


